(footprint "Ebyte_E22-900M22S"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "aqroot-beta-library")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Ebyte E22-900M22S SX1262 LoRa module, LCSC C411293. 22 castellated pads, 11 per long edge, 1.27 mm pitch with a 5.57 mm special gap between pins 3-4 and 19-20 where the IPEX connector sits. Body 14.0 +/-0.1 x 20.0 +/-0.1 mm, height 3.00 +/-0.1 mm. Pin 1 bottom-right, numbering counter-clockwise. Origin at body centre; pad field is asymmetric - 2.00 mm inset from the top edge to pins 11/12 and 1.00 mm from the bottom edge to pins 1/22. PRIMARY SOURCE: Ebyte manufacturer drawing in vendor/E22-900M22S/ (body, thickness, pitch, insets, pin 1, numbering, IPEX presence). SECONDARY: the exact-part LCSC/EasyEDA footprint for C411293 supplied ONLY the previously undimensioned 5.57 mm gap, and was cross-validated first - it reproduces body 14.000 x 20.000, insets 2.000/1.000 and pitch 1.27 exactly, and 9 x 1.27 + 5.57 = 17.000 closes against the pad-field span. No discrepancy against any manufacturer datum. ANTENNA END is +Y (pins 1-3, 20-22 and the IPEX connector). Beta uses the module IPEX/u.FL with Taoglas FXP890.07.0100C; pin 21 ANT stamp hole is NOT routed. RF DO NOT ROUTE until final RF review.")
	(tags "Ebyte E22-900M22S SX1262 LoRa module castellated IPEX C411293")
